node_modules/@mariozechner/pi-coding-agent/CHANGELOG.md:1708:- Fixed `pi update` for git packages to skip destructive reset, clean, and reinstall steps when the fetched target already matches the local checkout ([#2503](https://github.com/badlogic/pi-mono/issues/2503))
