node_modules/@mariozechner/pi-coding-agent/CHANGELOG.md:1910:- Fixed the default coding-agent system prompt to include only the current date in ISO format, not the current time, so prompt prefixes stay cacheable across reloads and resumed sessions ([#2131](https://github.com/badlogic/pi-mono/issues/2131))
