node_modules/@mariozechner/pi-coding-agent/CHANGELOG.md:4006:- **Session file validation**: `findMostRecentSession()` now validates session headers before returning, preventing non-session JSONL files from being loaded
node_modules/@mariozechner/pi-coding-agent/CHANGELOG.md:4015:- **Consolidated migrations**: Moved auth migration from `AuthStorage.migrateLegacy()` to new `migrations.ts` module.
node_modules/@mariozechner/pi-coding-agent/CHANGELOG.md:4022:- **Custom system prompts missing context**: When using a custom system prompt string, project context files (AGENTS.md), skills, date/time, and working directory were not appended. ([#321](https://github.com/badlogic/pi-mono/issues/321))
node_modules/@mariozechner/pi-coding-agent/CHANGELOG.md:4077:  - See updated [SDK documentation](docs/sdk.md) and [README](README.md)
node_modules/@mariozechner/pi-coding-agent/CHANGELOG.md:4201:- **Syntax highlighting stderr spam**: Fixed cli-highlight logging errors to stderr when markdown contains malformed code fences (e.g., missing newlines around closing backticks). Now validates language identifiers before highlighting and falls back silently to plain text. ([#274](https://github.com/badlogic/pi-mono/issues/274))
node_modules/@mariozechner/pi-coding-agent/CHANGELOG.md:4289:- **Hook onUpdate callback forwarding**: The `onUpdate` callback is now correctly forwarded through the hook wrapper, fixing custom tool progress updates. ([#238](https://github.com/badlogic/pi-mono/pull/238) by [@nicobailon](https://github.com/nicobailon))
node_modules/@mariozechner/pi-coding-agent/CHANGELOG.md:4321:- **Subagent example improvements**: Parallel mode now streams updates from all tasks. Chain mode shows all completed steps during streaming. Expanded view uses proper markdown rendering with syntax highlighting. Usage footer shows turn count.
node_modules/@mariozechner/pi-coding-agent/CHANGELOG.md:4323:- **Skills standard compliance**: Skills now adhere to the [Agent Skills standard](https://agentskills.io/specification). Validates name (must match parent directory, lowercase, max 64 chars), description (required, max 1024 chars), and frontmatter fields. Warns on violations but remains lenient. Prompt format changed to XML structure. Removed `{baseDir}` placeholder in favor of relative paths. ([#231](https://github.com/badlogic/pi-mono/issues/231))
node_modules/@mariozechner/pi-coding-agent/CHANGELOG.md:4383:- **Hooks**: `turn_end` event's `toolResults` type changed from `AppMessage[]` to `ToolResultMessage[]`. If you have hooks that handle `turn_end` events and explicitly type the results, update your type annotations.
node_modules/@mariozechner/pi-coding-agent/CHANGELOG.md:4441:- Updated `@mariozechner/pi-ai` with X-Initiator header support for GitHub Copilot, ensuring agent calls are not deducted from quota. ([#200](https://github.com/badlogic/pi-mono/pull/200) by [@kim0](https://github.com/kim0))
node_modules/@mariozechner/pi-coding-agent/CHANGELOG.md:4453:- Updated `@mariozechner/pi-ai` with interleaved thinking enabled by default for Anthropic Claude 4 models.
node_modules/@mariozechner/pi-coding-agent/CHANGELOG.md:4461:- Updated `@mariozechner/pi-ai` with interleaved thinking support for Anthropic models.
node_modules/@mariozechner/pi-coding-agent/CHANGELOG.md:4483:- Fixed read tool failing on macOS screenshot filenames due to Unicode Narrow No-Break Space (U+202F) in timestamp. Added fallback to try macOS variant paths and consolidated duplicate expandPath functions into shared path-utils.ts. ([#181](https://github.com/badlogic/pi-mono/pull/181) by [@nicobailon](https://github.com/nicobailon))
node_modules/@mariozechner/pi-coding-agent/CHANGELOG.md:4589:- **README restructured**: Reorganized documentation from 30+ flat sections into 10 logical groups. Converted verbose subsections to scannable tables. Consolidated philosophy sections. Reduced size by ~60% while preserving all information.
node_modules/@mariozechner/pi-coding-agent/CHANGELOG.md:4625:- **Collapse changelog setting**: Add `"collapseChangelog": true` to `~/.pi/agent/settings.json` to show a condensed "Updated to vX.Y.Z" message instead of the full changelog after updates. Use `/changelog` to view the full changelog. ([#148](https://github.com/badlogic/pi-mono/issues/148))
node_modules/@mariozechner/pi-coding-agent/CHANGELOG.md:4667:- **Faster startup**: Version check now runs in parallel with TUI initialization instead of blocking startup for up to 1 second. Update notifications appear in chat when the check completes.
node_modules/@mariozechner/pi-coding-agent/CHANGELOG.md:4743:- **Bun Binary Detection**: Fixed Bun compiled binary failing to start after Bun updated its virtual filesystem path format from `%7EBUN` to `$bunfs`. ([#95](https://github.com/badlogic/pi-mono/pull/95))
node_modules/@mariozechner/pi-coding-agent/CHANGELOG.md:4809:- Fix read path traversal vulnerability. Paths are now validated to prevent reading outside the working directory or its parents. The `read` tool can read from `cwd`, its ancestors (for config files), and all descendants. Symlinks are resolved before validation.
