+## S5. Stable prefix and late dynamic updates
+
+Original rank: 6.
+
+### Exact seam
+
+Keep `BORING_BASE_PROMPT_V1`, tool declarations, and static host append byte-identical.
+
+The existing dynamic seam is `buildDynamicPromptExtension` in the Pi harness.
