+## S3. Target-scoped nested instruction resolver
+
+Original ranks: 4 and 7.
+
+### Exact seam
+
+Create:
+`packages/agent/src/server/harness/pi-coding-agent/nestedInstructions.ts`.
+
+Expose:
+
+```ts
+resolveInstructionsForTarget(workspaceRoot, target): ResolvedInstructionSet
+```
+
+Canonicalize the target before walking parents.
+Reject paths outside the workspace after symlink resolution.
